mukou da to wakatte temo issho ni tameshitai no

00:22:37.380 --> 00:22:43.340
Even if I know it's useless I want to try it out together

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:50.310
nanni mo iranai ne kimi ga warau tabi

00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:50.310
I don't need anything, hey whenever you laugh

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:56.230
ikiteru sono imi wa toki akasarete

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:56.230
the meaning of my life becomes obvious to me

00:22:56.230 --> 00:23:02.530
unmei nante ne zenbu de kimi shidai

00:22:56.230 --> 00:23:02.530
All kinds of fate depend on you

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:08.890
tsuiteku doko made mo onaji kimochi wo

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:08.890
I'll follow you carrying the same

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:14.320
tsuyoi kimochi wo kakaete

00:23:09.190 --> 00:23:14.320
strong feelings

00:23:17.860 --> 00:23:19.290
Let's go, Haihane!

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:22.140
If we lose this time... we'll get punished.

00:23:22.140 --> 00:23:23.010
Punished?

00:23:23.010 --> 00:23:25.960
Punishment is the basis of the three evils.

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:28.490
Three evils? Doesn't that sound lame?!

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:31.070
Twelfth Wing: The Tower of Chaotic Play.

00:23:31.250 --> 00:23:32.930
Next time will be forever and ever, too.

00:23:32.930 --> 00:23:34.550
Punishment time it is...

00:23:34.550 --> 00:23:35.740
Stop it already!
